### ADDITION 6: M13 SLM — 20 EXT SYSTEMS (10 Kept + 10 New)

**Best-in-Class References:**
- **llama.cpp:** GGUF format, KV cache, continuous batching, flash attention, OpenAI-compatible server
- **Runtime Local LLM (UE5 Plugin):** SPSC queues, token streaming, background thread, safety filtering
- **arXiv 2601.23206:** Aggressive fine-tuning on scoped tasks, narrow context, constrained structure, DAG-based synthetic data
- **Local AI Master Pattern:** Inference server (llama-server) + NPC controller + SQLite memory + TTS pipeline

**Our Implementation (20 EXT — 10 Kept + 10 New):**

| Slot | System | Status | Inputs → Output | Reference Pattern |
