**All Prompts Externalized as Jinja2 Templates (`data/slm_prompts/<tag>.j2`):**
```jinja2
{# data/slm_prompts/companion_bark.j2 #}
{% set personality = personality|default("Survivor") %}
{% set health = healthPct|default(100) %}
{% set ammo = ammoPct|default(100) %}
{% set order = currentOrder|default("Follow") %}
{% set enemy = enemyType|default("hostile") %}
{% set weather = weather|default("clear") %}

{% if personality == "Cynic" %}
"Great. Another {{ enemy }}. Just what I needed. {{ 'And it\\'s raining.' if weather == 'rain' else '' }}"
{% elif personality == "Idealist" %}
"We can save them! Cover me!"
{% elif personality == "Mercenary" %}
"Pay's not worth this. {{ playerHealth|default('Fine') }}."
{% elif personality == "Scholar" %}
"Fascinating. The {{ enemy }}'s morphology suggests {{ keyFacts[0]|default('mutation') }}."
{% else %}
"Contact {{ enemy }}! {{ urgency|default('Engaging') }}."
{% endif %}
```
- **Modders override** via `mods/<mod>/slm_prompts/`
- **Template fields = component fields** — type-safe at compile time via codegen

**SLM Runtime Architecture (Verified Correct):**
- **Dedicated compute queue** (M0 `FindDedicatedComputeQueueFamily`)
- **SPSC request/result queues** (lock-free, 256-entry ring, cache-line aligned)
- **1–2 tokens/frame throttle** (main thread never blocked)
- **Result delivery:** Main thread drains result queue → writes `outText` on component
- **KV cache:** `n_ctx=512`, `Q4_K_M` MiniCPM5-1B (~800MB VRAM) — fits Tier 0 (6GB)
- **Model:** MiniCPM5-1B Q4_K_M (Apache 2.0, 688MB, 1.08B params, 24 layers, GQA 16:2)

