### [M2-EXT-05] Mechanical Muscle Exhaustion Joint-Friction Damping Adder

> **tags** · general
> **tl;dr** · Mechanical Muscle Exhaustion Joint-Friction Damping Adder
> **ctx** · M2.9-EXT-12 — M2.9 traversal, ballistics & survival physiology.
> **meta** · depends-on: - · depended-by: -

##### Systems Touched
Character locomotion + melee (reads [M2-EXT-43]), stamina, animation. Depends on [M2] Jolt.

##### Math
Per-joint damping `τ=-c(ω)·ω`; `c(ω)=c0·(1-0.7f)`, fatigue `f∈[0,1]`; recovery `df/dt=-k_rec·(1-f)` (k_rec≈0.05/s). Torque capped at `τ_max·(1-f)`.

##### Algorithm
1. Track joint ω from Jolt. 2. Fatigue accrues on high-torque swings. 3. Damping drops → slower/wider swings. 4. Rest recovers f. Player loop: exhausted = sluggish melee, must rest/eat.

##### Examples
