### [M2-EXT-35] Atmospheric Powder-Fouling Friction Accumulation

> **tags** · general
> **tl;dr** · Complements M2.7 core weapon mechanics, writes the canonical BarrelHeat.fouling field (locked in M2.7's base Implementation Steps), and scales over M10 envir...
> **ctx** · M2.9-EXT-12 — M2.9 traversal, ballistics & survival physiology.
