### [M2-EXT-79] Interaction Proficiency

> **tags** · 
> **tl;dr** · M2/M8. Each interaction minigame has a proficiency track (weld/hotwire/lockpick/hack/sleight) fed by M8-EXT-18 XP; higher proficiency widens windows, shortens looms, reduces noise.
> **ctx** · M2.9-EXT-12 — M2.9 traversal, ballistics & survival physiology.
