<!-- From Archive M2 -->
### [M2-EXT-127]

> **tags** · m2.9, system
> **tl;dr** · Disease / Infection Contagion Spread — M2-EXT-127.
> **ctx** · M2.9-EXT-34 — M2.9 proximity-density contagion.
> **meta** · depends-on: — · depended-by: -
Disease / Infection Contagion Spread

##### Systems Touched
M2.9 illness + M5.4 bite + M5.4-EXT-17 karma + SLM world news.

##### Math
beta = R0 / (kappa * D);  // R0 = beta/gamma; kappa=contact rate, D=infectious duration
p = 1.0f - expf(-beta * density * (mask?0.3f:1.0f) * dt); if(rand()<p) Infect(target)

##### Algorithm
Illnesses (zombie pathogen via bites, flu in shelters) spread by proximity density; masks + isolation cut transmission. SLM broadcasts outbreaks.

##### Examples
```cpp
float beta = R0 / (kappa * D);
float p = 1.0f - expf(-beta * density * (mask?0.3f:1.0f) * dt);
if(near(infected) && rand()<p) Contract(disease);
```

##### Failure Modes

p now dt-scaled via hazard form (1-exp(-beta*density*dt)); ensure kappa*D>0 to avoid div-by-zero.
Mask 0.3 factor applies globally → confirm it should also reduce bite transmission.
near() radius static → infects at any distance or never at the edge.


##### Player-Facing Impact
Crowded camps become outbreak risks - isolation and masks matter.

