> **tl;dr** · Tier-1 quality ladder. Reads G-Buffer depth+normal from M4.5 deferred pass. Outputs occlusion term multiplied into ambient/SH fill (complements M10-EXT-03 SH am
> **ctx** · Scalable Ambient Obscurance (SSAO) *(SOURCED FROM PLAN FILE) -- Tier-1 quality ladder. Reads G-Buffer depth+normal from M4.5 deferred pass. Outputs occlusion term multiplied into ambient/SH fill (complements M10-EXT-03 SH ambient).
