### [M4-EXT-86] Vulkan Host-Visible Page-Pool Memory Defragmentation Compiler

> **tags** · general
> **tl;dr** · Chunk streaming allocator ([M4]), Vulkan ([M0]) host-visible heap. Depends on [M0].
> **ctx** · Vulkan Host-Visible Page-Pool Memory Defragmentation Compiler -- Chunk streaming allocator ([M4]), Vulkan ([M0]) host-visible heap. Depends on [M0].
> **meta** · depends-on: [M4-EXT-86] · depended-by: -

##### Systems Touched
Chunk streaming allocator ([M4]), Vulkan ([M0]) host-visible heap. Depends on [M0].

##### Math
Fragmentation `F=1-(largest_free_run/N)`. Defrag when `F>F_max`: memcpy live pages to packed run, rebind descriptors (double-buffer). Cost O(live_pages).

##### Algorithm
1. Free bitmap. 2. If F>thresh, compact live pages. 3. Rebind descriptors atomically. 4. Free old span.

