### [M5-EXT-22] Screamer Convergence & Holling Type II Cannibalism Feeding

> **tags** · II
> **tl;dr** · Screamer Convergence & Holling Type II Cannibalism Feeding
> **ctx** · Screamer Convergence & Holling Type II Cannibalism Feeding
> **meta** · depends-on: - · depended-by: -

##### Systems Touched
Horde feeding on survivors ([M8] SEIR infected), scent/fear grid ([M5] diffusion), animation. Depends on [M1] ECS.

##### Math
Holling Type II functional response: `f(N)=a·N/(1+a·h·N)` — feeding rate saturates as prey density N rises (handling time h). Cannibalism convergence: screamers flock to max scent-gradient cell `g=∇S`; convergence `dx/dt = α·g - β·(x - x_flock)`.

##### Algorithm
1. Sample local prey density N. 2. Feeding rate = Holling f(N) (saturation, not linear). 3. Screamers steer along scent gradient ∇S. 4. On kill, emit scent spike → more converge (cannibalism cascade).

##### Examples
-

##### Failure Modes
