### [M8-EXT-09] Memory-Mapped FlatBinary Inventory Cache Dictionary

> **tags** · FlatBinary
> **tl;dr** · M8. Memory-maps a flat-binary item-definition dictionary for instant lookup.
> **ctx** · Memory-Mapped FlatBinary Inventory Cache Dictionary -- M8. Memory-maps a flat-binary item-definition dictionary for instant lookup.
> **meta** · depends-on: [M8-EXT-09] · depended-by: -

##### Systems Touched
M8. Memory-maps a flat-binary item-definition dictionary for instant lookup.

##### Math
ItemDef* def = mmap(dict)[id]; // no parse on access;

##### Algorithm
Item definitions live in a flat binary mmap'd at load; lookup is a direct offset (no per-item parse), so inventory/loot resolution is O(1) and zero-alloc. Pairs with M8-EXT-10 icon gen.

